/target
*.db
*.db-journal
# WAL sidecars, which appeared when `db::init_pool` started setting journal_mode=WAL in
# Phase 10. `*.db` does not match them, and `-wal` holds recent writes — real user data.
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# Manual copies of the database (e.g. fridge.db.pre-phase5-backup) — real user data, and
# `*.db` alone doesn't match a suffixed filename.
*.db.*
.env
# Hand-labelled mail for 8b's measurement (`labelset export`). Real subject lines and
# snippets from the burner inbox — same reason `*.db` is above. Deliberately not `*.csv`,
# which would also catch the vendored FoodKeeper snapshots in data/.
/labelsets/
